   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-03-23",
   "text": "Exit Tax Prevention Act of 2021\n This bill prohibits a state, or taxing jurisdiction in the state, from imposing an income tax, wealth tax, or any similar tax on a resident who has relocated permanent residence to another state or taxing jurisdiction."
